<title>BRAZIL: Brazil May 2 coffee regs 3.39 mln bags to June.</title>
<headline>Brazil May 2 coffee regs 3.39 mln bags to June.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil coffee export registrations as of May 2 totaled 3.39 million bags for April, May and June, according to the May 9 bulletin of Rio de Janeiro Coffee Center.</p>
<p>A breakdown by month was as follows.</p>
<p> MONTH     REGISTRATIONS IN 60-KG BAGS</p>
<p> April		  1,456,358</p>
<p> May		    1,498,437</p>
<p> June		     431,458</p>
<p> TOTAL		  3,386,253</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
